Quadcuber A1 boundary analysis: energy_E1_T0.005_Hz1_R151.5
* Original simplified model; NOT a manufacturer macro-model.
Vpower power 0 PWL(0 0 0.001 0 0.0035 400 0.006 0 1.001 0 1.0035 400 1.006 0 2.001 0 2.0035 400 2.006 0 3.001 0 3.0035 400 3.006 0 4.001 0 4.0035 400 4.006 0)
Bregen 0 vm I=v(power)/max(v(vm),1)
Cbulk vm 0 0.002256 ic=9.18
BTVS vm 0 I=max((v(vm)-14.7)/0.172185,0)
Rbleed vm 0 151.5
Bhold 0 vm I=min(max((9.18-v(vm))/0.1,0),6.5)
.ic v(vm)=9.18
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-9 vntol=1e-7 method=gear
.control
set wr_vecnames
set wr_singlescale
save all @btvs[i] @bhold[i]
tran 5e-05 4.015 0 5e-05
wrdata waveform.txt v(vm) @btvs[i] v(power) @bhold[i]
quit
.endc
.end
